{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/2768928badce6d4965877184f8912ba5.poster.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/2768928badce6d4965877184f8912ba5.webm?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/2768928badce6d4965877184f8912ba5.mp4?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An online co-op horror show with up to 6 players. Your camera and microphone are part of the gameplay. Don\u2019t blink. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t scream. Don\u2019t trust anyone. The Host is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/a66312c211a74659ad2c8d07f3cc7326.poster.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/a66312c211a74659ad2c8d07f3cc7326.webm?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/a66312c211a74659ad2c8d07f3cc7326.mp4?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the supervision of a deranged yet charismatic Host, players face a series of twisted mini-challenges: don\u2019t blink, don\u2019t scream, solve a quiz \u2014 and try not to lose your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/97581465a8e2539920f9133ccb218250.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1000 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/c59c99aa1088ccee42f2f6058d86aed2.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1000 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminated players don\u2019t disappear.<br>They watch, listen, and sometimes\u2026 interfere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the dead decide who makes it to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/9f4c1dfac6e3ec941f6e83032b5824dd.poster.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/9f4c1dfac6e3ec941f6e83032b5824dd.webm?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/9f4c1dfac6e3ec941f6e83032b5824dd.mp4?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/baaffc5226c23f04f5c98189f6991364.webp?t=1768817092\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new task, a new mechanic, and a new way to lose control. The Host comments on your every move, mocks your failures, and reveals dark secrets between rounds. A single session lasts 10\u201330 minutes \u2014 and ends when only one remains\u2026 or no one does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/fc03fbb1ad5f3c779ee16c7686bc6ff0.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1000 height=400 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154290?t=1768817092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/0fe925a2e6907caf5142b78a2ef00abb59ebe2cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768817092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/2190e0d9dea43cc4f2ec20d36fe1a97f385090cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768817092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/2190e0d9dea43cc4f2ec20d36fe1a97f385090cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768817092","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/cfc7897728f93ff75bc74918c5adde97.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1560 height=787 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/2768928badce6d4965877184f8912ba5.poster.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/2768928badce6d4965877184f8912ba5.webm?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9