ere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, the dead decide who makes it to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/9f4c1dfac6e3ec941f6e83032b5824dd.poster.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/9f4c1dfac6e3ec941f6e83032b5824dd.webm?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/9f4c1dfac6e3ec941f6e83032b5824dd.mp4?t=1768817092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/baaffc5226c23f04f5c98189f6991364.webp?t=1768817092\" width=1000 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new task, a new mechanic, and a new way to lose control. The Host comments on your every move, mocks your failures, and reveals dark secrets between rounds. A single session lasts 10\u201330 minutes \u2014 and ends when only one remains\u2026 or no one does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/extras/fc03fbb1ad5f3c779ee16c7686bc6ff0.avif?t=1768817092\" width=1000 height=400 /></span></p>","developers":["QorSoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154290/af86a2fd92c72145a5c172ad1ed51911e87da8b8/header.jpg?t=1768817092","is_free":false,"l